          m_StringArgument: In this menu you can access and view your stats. These are split up into 6 stats, Athleticism, Stem, Arts, Charisma, Health, and Stress. The first four of those are permanent traits that can be trained through activities and minigames, the latter two must be constantly managed to live a happy and healthy life by taking care of yourself (eating healthy meals and exercising, for example).
          m_BoolArgument: 0
        m_CallState: 2
      - m_Target: {fileID: 507}
        m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.UI.Text, UnityEngine.UI
